# Every line of .gitattributes exists for one reason: keep the line endings
# predictable, on every platform, for every checkout.
#
# BobShit reads both LF and CRLF, and the regression suite proves it with
# lang/tests/11_crlf.shit, but the sources themselves stay LF so a diff stays
# readable and a build stays reproducible.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The one file that must keep its CRLF, otherwise the test that guards the
# lexer would stop testing anything.
lang/tests/11_crlf.shit -text
